{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Credit Card Calculator 為持有信用卡欠款、希望有計劃地清還的用戶而設，把還款所需時間、每月應繳金額與利息成本等疑問化成清晰數字。程式原價 US $0.99，現時<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，方便你在消費前先看清還款代價。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-83.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>四合一信用卡還款計算</h2>\n<p>程式把四種計算工具整合於一身：輸入固定每月還款額，可算出清還欠款所需時間與總支出；反過來設定還款期限，則可推算每月應繳金額；另有最低還款額與單月持卡成本計算。介面直觀易用，屬獨立運作的應用程式，離線時同樣順暢，亦不設廣告與追蹤。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-127-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-128-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-129-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-130-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-131-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-132-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Credit Card Calculator</li><li>應用類別：Finance</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/credit-card-calculator/id6475016329?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T04:20:29.805824+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":296,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-25T19:44:43+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T14:08:59.165402+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T04:14:06.325182+00:00","content_hash":"408a7ae20038388bf59c42369f978e180d246d4b14b813fdc61be06dac43025b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}